From d1124a73eee2d0763e3a2e474941b22a06dea0f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert Mader <robert.mader@collabora.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:45:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 064/107] temp/libcamera: Update to 0.8.0

Lots of exciting changes, see:
https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/camera/libcamera/-/releases/v0.8.0

Additional changes:
1. Sync with aports, dropping ipa subpackage
2. Drop patches that got upstreamed
3. Move tuning files from ipa/simple -> ipa/softisp
4. Add downstream patch to set min/max resolutions via tuning files and
   use it to limit the Librem5 cameras to 640x480, allowing apps like
   Snapshot to perform decently when paired with Mesa 26.3
5. Add CCMs to Librem5 cameras
6. Remove CCM from IMX800 - it arguably hurt more than it helped

Part-of: <https://gitlab.nura.eco/nura/pmaports/-/merge_requests/9821>
